;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\mountain-stream1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Eiichiro<STYLE ID="1"> vanished from my life.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Eiichiro<STYLE ID="1">―I wanted him to come back.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Eiichiro's<STYLE ID="1"> feelings when he tried to save me, and how much he suffered.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">I couldn't heal that heart of his.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, I couldn't because it was me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Eiichiro<STYLE ID="1">―is he doing well?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I want to know that much, at least... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I want to know.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\水田.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Eiichiro<STYLE ID="2">, huh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Now in high school, we talk about </STYLE>Eiichiro<STYLE ID="1"> while we do the spring rice planting.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"He's doing well, I hear. Seems he's being a proper high school student."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I see... I'm glad..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If I can hear just that much, it's enough.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Eiichiro<STYLE ID="1"> and I may not be able to meet, but it's enough just knowing he's well.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">still love </STYLE>Eiichiro<STYLE ID="2">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"What,</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="4">what!?</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "300"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Well?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Right on the heels of those sudden words, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> presses me further.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">My heart is pounding, leaping around inside my chest.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Well what! Why would you ask something like that...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You think I haven't noticed?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Sorry. If you don't want to, you don't have to say."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"............</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Yeah... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I love him. Even now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">That single reply is all </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> gives before he goes back to silently planting seedlings.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">My feet, soaking in the paddy, are chilly.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But deep in my chest, it's so hot.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">I've been aware of my own feelings.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But I've never told anyone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Eiichiro<STYLE ID="1"> has never heard it, and neither has </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So now that someone has said it out loud, my body is reacting violently.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">My whole body is hot―</STYLE><PG>
Eiichiro's<STYLE ID="1"> feelings about me, whatever they were, I don't know.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But since he went away from me, then even if he did have feelings for me, he probably has no lingering attachment.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Love isn't something you can do alone, so I know I have no choice but to give up too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I'm not the one who can heal </STYLE>Eiichiro<STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In that case, the person I'm allowed to have feelings for is...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">What a brazen way to put it: 'the person I'm allowed to have feelings for.'</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It's as if I'm the one in charge, drawing up how everyone's feelings fit together. How presumptuous.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If I'm having thoughts that presumptuous, I must be lonely.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">No, it isn't a feeling as pretty as loneliness.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I'm just starved.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">He</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> isn't here, so I'm starved.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">I watch </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> as he plants seedlings, moving farther away from me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Eiichiro<STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> look very much alike.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I can tell them apart by their expressions and the way they talk, but with blank faces, it's nearly impossible.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But their personalities are complete opposites.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Confident, positive </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and servile, pessimistic </STYLE>Eiichiro<STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is the kind of person who could live a sturdy life even without someone like me.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But </STYLE>Eiichiro<STYLE ID="1"> was different.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Eiichiro<STYLE ID="1"> felt somehow inferior, and held back around us.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So I meant to let </STYLE>Eiichiro<STYLE ID="1"> know, without saying it, that his place to belong was here, that it was me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Eiichiro<STYLE ID="1"> could stay here, I meant, without worrying about anything.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I couldn't say it outright because those feelings had turned into an aching affection.</STYLE><PG>
Eiichiro<STYLE ID="1"> staying by my side put me at ease, as if he thought of me as his place to belong.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Eiichiro<STYLE ID="1"> just being near me filled me up, too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">What am I thinking?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">When </STYLE>Eiichiro<STYLE ID="1"> has already gone away from me.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "10000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">The sun is getting high, so we decide to finish today's planting.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家庭.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">On the Niimuras' veranda, I'm treated to rice balls and tea.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and I cram rice balls into our mouths together.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Us, you know... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Let's get married."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Hearing that, I choke like someone in a manga.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Rice up my windpipe. Rice up my </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="びこう">nose</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. I can't stop </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="せき">coughing</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and sniffling.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"You don't have to react that dramatically..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Cough! Sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">At times like this, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> usually rubs my back or something, but today he just stares down at the ground.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Well, think it over."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh... you mean it...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, I mean it. I can make </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> happy."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">It's that I want to be happy..."</STYLE><PG>
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">While I sit there with my mouth hanging open, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> scratches his head and goes into the house.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A grain of rice falls out of my mouth, and at last I come back to myself.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">There's no way I can answer something like this right away.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This may be the countryside, but high schoolers suddenly becoming husband and wife...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">What should I do?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"What should I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">What should I do?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, what's wrong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">All at once, my mind came back to reality.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\昼の月.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家庭.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱子供バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="のぞ">peering</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> into my face, looking worried.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"So I dozed off on the veranda..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... were you talking in your sleep?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"No, it's nothing."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, if you're sleepy, I'll look after </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, okay?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">In my arms, </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, born last summer, was sleeping peacefully.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I hadn't been able to sleep lately.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Day after day, with so much on my mind, I'd look up and find it was already morning.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Then, could I ask you to?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... okay. Should I lay out </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> futon?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm fine like this."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Okaaay."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> ran happily over to </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Kana's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> toy box.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I feel like I can sleep better dozing out here than on a futon.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">It seemed I'd been dreaming of my high-school days.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Eiichiro<STYLE ID="1"> going away, a proposal from </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">At some point I came to have feelings for </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> too, and we married after high school.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Eiichiro<STYLE ID="1">, too, married a wonderful woman named </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, beautiful and </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="かいがい">devoted</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and he started coming home now and then.</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "251" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">With that, my worries and my feelings should have been gone completely.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">But two years ago―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "escapescape.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\柵尖り血.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Eiichiro<STYLE ID="1"> died in an accident.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Since then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and her adopted daughter </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had been living hand to mouth, day after day.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">What's more, </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was apparently being bullied at school.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Just the other day, </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had called me out to Megasawa City to ask for my advice.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">I know very well what it feels like to suffer from bullying.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But the difference between me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is that she has no one at her side to protect her.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> has no one but </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> to help her. And there's no one nearby who can help </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> herself.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Moving to this settlement isn't permitted under </STYLE><STYLE ID="14" RUBY="おきて">the rule</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">To me, </STYLE><STYLE ID="14" RUBY="おきて">the rule</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> of this Arata settlement is something I must keep even if it kills me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="14" RUBY="おきて">Keeping the rule</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is the same as protecting the settlement and its people.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If it's ever broken, then just as with </STYLE>Eiichiro<STYLE ID="1">, something terrible is sure to happen again.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Ever since then, I've made a point of keeping </STYLE><STYLE ID="14" RUBY="おきて">the rule</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, the crystallized wisdom of those who came before us.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If only so that there's never again a tragedy like </STYLE>Eiichiro's<STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\春の山.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家庭.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">If I talked over </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Mifuyu-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> situation with </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">my mother-in-law</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">'Wouldn't it be all right if they just moved here?'</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is probably what she'd say.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">My mother-in-law</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, though she's the head of the settlement, is frank and practical.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But even the Grand Witch isn't permitted to break the rule, and if the Grand Witch were to break the rule, what tragedy would follow?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">With fears like that swirling inside me, I hadn't been able to ask her.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">The most I can do is send them daily necessities.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And only once, so it isn't seen as ongoing support.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But even I don't have anything valuable enough to support </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and her daughter for long.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If only I could at least send something that would sell for a good price...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">In the warm spring sunshine, I gazed absently at the clouds floating in the sky.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\追加分\鍛冶.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "800" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Then, from somewhere, came the sound of metal striking metal.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It was coming from Shirozaki-san's house.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">He must be making nata and maces again.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">............</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But there is... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Here in the Arata settlement, there are things that sell for a lot.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "3000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\鉈とハンマー.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Nata and maces.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">They're used not just as practical tools but as ritual implements, too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The nata and maces Shirozaki-san makes do actually get sold outside sometimes.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Yes, and then I could send Noh masks and red robes along with them.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Neither the Noh masks nor the red robes are cheap.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Two sets is probably the most I can put together.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even so, they should sell for several hundred thousand yen.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If I remember right, there should be some stored in the underground storeroom.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\春の山.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家庭.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Maybe because I'd hit on a way out, my sleepiness was blown away all at once.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, I'm going out for a bit, so could you look after </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> a little longer?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜赤ちゃん逆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱子供バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... leave it to me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> would be 11 soon, so it was fine to leave </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> with her.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Besides, just the other day, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had shown signs of growing into a woman.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\洞窟内川.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I hardly ever came near this place except to take out the ritual implements.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It brought back that business with </STYLE>Eiichiro<STYLE ID="1">, and I found it hard to breathe.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had started going off to play in the mountains on her own, and since then I'd had her keep watch over this place, calling it the secret base.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> seemed to like it here too, and with someone going in and out regularly, it was easy to check things like cave-ins inside the cave and how much water had </STYLE><STYLE ID="16" RUBY="た">pooled</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\壺を置く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\エデン\桐箱.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">There were plenty of nata and maces.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The Noh masks and red robes were well preserved, too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So they wouldn't spoil even inside the cave, they were kept in </STYLE><STYLE ID="17" RUBY="きり">paulownia</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> boxes made for them.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A cave with </STYLE><STYLE ID="17" RUBY="きり">paulownia</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> boxes in it was a mismatched bit of interior design, but it was the best way to keep things in good condition.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Now all I had to do was load these into the car and take them to a shipping company.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But I was a little uneasy.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had asked me </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">'Is there no way to kill the kids who bully </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">?'</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> when she came to me for advice.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">However much they might sell for, I'd be sending nata and maces that can kill.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Just in case, I'll include a letter.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Asking her not to kill with them, but to sell them and live on the money.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="11">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is a smart woman.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Having done the mountain seclusion, </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">she</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> would surely understand that killing someone with weapons this big is very hard.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Still, to be doubly sure, I'll include the letter.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">As soon as tomorrow, I'll send them off to </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But this won't solve the root of the problem.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It won't make the bullying go away, and even if they use the money to move somewhere else, there's no guarantee </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> will </STYLE><STYLE ID="18" RUBY="なじ">fit in</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> at a new school.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">If even this help doesn't work... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">that's when I'll talk to </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">my mother-in-law</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="14" RUBY="おきて">Within the rule</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I'll do everything I can, and only if that fails will I start thinking about doing something about </STYLE><STYLE ID="14" RUBY="おきて">the rule</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> itself.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">I'll be using the car tomorrow, so I should tell </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> about this too.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">―That evening, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, worn out from playing perhaps, fell asleep together in the living room.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="15">My mother-in-law</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was out, saying something about errands.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">She'd probably gone into town again to </STYLE><STYLE ID="19" RUBY="そろ">stock up</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> on costumes and props for her hobby.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It was just me, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and our two daughters at home.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I'm heading into the mountains tomorrow too, so can I ask you a favor?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"You are?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> rarely went into the mountains himself.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Usually </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> directed things from the settlement, and everyone else went into the mountains as the working crew.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> wanted me to do a danger reading for tomorrow.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\三畳間夕方.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The usual room.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This was the room I used to foresee danger.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This room sat quietly at the very end of the second floor―hardly anyone came near it, not even family.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">It looked like there was a little time before dark.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I'll tell him about that matter now, while I can.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, I told you I saw </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> the other day, didn't I?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hm? Oh, right, you went to Megasawa, didn't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I hadn't told </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> the details yet.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was the </STYLE><STYLE ID="20" RUBY="たち">type</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> who wouldn't ask until I brought it up myself.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\登山夕日.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="11">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Haruka's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> situation now, and what she had asked of me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And what I meant to do about it. I told </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> all of it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> listened in silence, nodding again and again.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and her daughter―even if we tried moving them here, we've got </STYLE><STYLE ID="21" RUBY="おきて">the rule</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> on our end, so it won't be that simple..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, so I thought I'd at least send them things they could turn into money. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">So tomorrow I want to go to the delivery depot in </STYLE><STYLE ID="22" RUBY="とよたけ">Toyotake</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I'm going to the mountains tomorrow, so I don't mind </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> using the car. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> twisted his mouth a little.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\三畳間夕方.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Is that alone going to work out...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Selling nata and maces is, if anything, a plan that relies on </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Mifuyu-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> conscience.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even with a letter enclosed, there's no guarantee that </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, already thinking in terms of killing, won't use them as weapons.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Calling her ahead of time would be no different.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'll write it clearly in the letter so there's no misunderstanding. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">Mifuyu-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> cell phone seems to have been cut off, too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Well, </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> would know that if she misused what </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> sent her, even her standing here could be in danger... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Do you have the things ready?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, I've boxed them up in the underground storeroom. I'm planning to bring them up tomorrow."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Then I'll help you with that before I head to the mountains."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "7000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\三畳間割れる暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Just then, the room quietly went dark.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The sun seemed to have set completely.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">Mifuyu-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> situation looks like it'll work out somehow, so now I'll focus on foreseeing the dangers waiting for </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> tomorrow.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">There's nothing in particular I have to do to use my foresight.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">As long as I'm in a dark, cramped place, my sixth sense foresees things on its own.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even so, at those times I close my eyes and take a deep, quiet breath.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There's no great meaning in it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Doing it just puts me a little more in the mood.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Besides, when the person being read for sees me like this, they believe in my foresight all the more.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Though for people from this settlement, theatrics like this probably aren't needed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">At first, nobody believed in my foresight at all.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But since I was a child, and still now, I've tried to live as honestly as I can, so that I could be of help to everyone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Maybe thanks to that, at some point people came to believe in my foresight.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Above all, if my foresight hit the mark, no one could complain.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But at one point, a question came to me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Why had an ability like this sprouted in me?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I noticed this ability existed in the spring I started high school.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Eiichiro<STYLE ID="1"> was lost to me, and in his place I gained this power.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even now, its cause remains unknown.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Now, then.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kotaro's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> danger will be...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱子供うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">―!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">What I'd just seen was </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> wasn't the one―it was </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱子供殺気.gal" "NORMAL" "32" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\鎖の大地.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "20" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Haah! Haah! Haah!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\三畳間割れる暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, what's wrong...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is coming...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The words hadn't come out of my own will.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">My sixth sense had voiced the threat through my mouth on its own.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">is coming to kill me...!</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱子供バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, about the third-year memorial service coming up―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Unlike the one in my head, it was the usual </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱子供うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8"><TXSPS>"Ugh...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　Ghhk-k-k-k...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPN>Suddenly </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> clutched her head and crouched down.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Yes, this is it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">After this, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> will―</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱子供殺気大.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">die...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\ナイフ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "540" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n200\r\n3000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n200\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">please die...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内早歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1,アイテム1" "32" "200" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Stop!"</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\布団.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\三畳間割れる暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{QUAKE "人物1" "QUAKE" "1" "5" "0" "0" "30"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱幸太郎.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> pinned </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> down just in time.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> didn't try to shake </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> off. Her eyes stayed on me, and she pointed the knife my way.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="23">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="24">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="23">! Please, die!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="23">　Just die!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">My danger sense wouldn't stop.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I could only give myself over, </STYLE><STYLE ID="25" RUBY="ぼうぜん">dazed</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, to the sixth sense echoing through my brain.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, it was all so much that I didn't know what to do, or how to act.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, what are you doing! Run, hurry!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Threading through the gaps between the alarm bells in my head, I heard </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> voice.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内早歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{QUAKESTOP "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Doing as he said, I left the room.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\新村本家2階廊下暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Wait, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">! Die! Diiiiie!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In the dim room, I'd caught a faint glimpse of </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> face.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It looked less like hatred for me than terrible suffering, filled with </STYLE><STYLE ID="26" RUBY="くもん">anguish</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It was as if someone were strangling </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and it was trying to tell me the one doing it was me.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="15">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">, what happened!? What's all this noise!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="15">My mother-in-law</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> took one look at my face and went straight into the three-mat room.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">And soon after, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> screams cut off abruptly.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="15">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">, come in."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">My mother-in-law</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> beckoned to me through the gap in the door.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Apparently she'd struck </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> in a vital spot and knocked her out.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "bittersweet.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\三畳間割れる暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, what is this...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"I don't know either..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">My mother-in-law</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> stroked the collapsed </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> on the </STYLE><STYLE ID="27" RUBY="ほお">cheek</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and gazed steadily at her face.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="15">"It'll be trouble if anyone else finds out about this. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">, listen carefully. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">Right now, we're going to hide </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="15"> in the underground storeroom where no one will see. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">I'll keep an eye on </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">, you search the storehouse's books for a way to fix this."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hide her?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"You know how this settlement is, don't you?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">　If </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="15"> causes a commotion like this, some people will start seeing her as dangerous. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">If that happens, we won't be able to go on living here like we always have."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"G-got it...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, what should I do...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="15"> just act normal, the same as always, until </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="15"> settles down. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">Someone asking for a danger reading might come again as soon as tomorrow."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"But with </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> like this, I...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="15">"Me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="15"> are enough. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">Besides, what about </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="15"> needs someone by her side, and the one to do it is </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">, her mother. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Your</STYLE><STYLE ID="15"> job is to play 'the Niimura family as usual.'"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Understood..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"All right, I'll lead the way to the underground storeroom. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">, bring </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">, now."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地入口.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Before long, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was locked up in the underground storeroom.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Soon after, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> woke up, and I was told she kept screaming from the pit of her stomach for me to die.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵本棚真横.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">In time, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> found passages on the Green-Eye Curse-Killing and Droga in the storehouse's books.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, it seemed, would need falsificaso to be cured.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Falsificaso wasn't anything rare in Arata, and making it was no problem.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But there was a big wall in the way.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Until now, we had never injected falsificaso into a person.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Would it really cure her? Was it even harmless to the human body in the first place?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Chigaya's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> body might or might not be poisoned by it, and we had no way to find out.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, test the falsificaso on me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No! </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> both need </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　So I'll be the one...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"No! If anything happened to </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, there'd be no one left who could come up with a plan!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Then what do we do!? Use it on </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> straight off!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　If it fails, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> might die! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Did </STYLE>Eiichiro<STYLE ID="2"> make Droga, by any chance?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"What...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"When </STYLE>Eiichiro<STYLE ID="2"> got badly hurt, did </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> touch </STYLE>Eiichiro's<STYLE ID="2"> blood?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"That's..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Well, either way, how we cure </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> isn't something we can tell </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Why...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That </STYLE>Eiichiro<STYLE ID="2"> made Droga for </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">―</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s going to suspect that, isn't she?"</STYLE><PG>
Eiichiro<STYLE ID="1"> broke </STYLE><STYLE ID="14" RUBY="おきて">the rule</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and made Droga.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I see. That I'd been bathed in his blood and gained this precognition from it―that was </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> view.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">After a sin like that, committed by </STYLE>Eiichiro<STYLE ID="1">, how would the residents look at his family, </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, from now on?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Having married in from outside to begin with, </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">my mother-in-law</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> would probably let it pass, and so would her son, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But I know very well how this place is.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The people here are terribly sensitive to anything that could become a threat.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="11">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> too, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> too, and even </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, green-eyed like her...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even where </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">my mother-in-law</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was concerned, the fewer people who knew about this, the better.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"All right, I'll try asking someone who'll use Droga."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Someone who'll use Droga...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"They probably wouldn't use falsificaso by itself, but I'll give them Droga as an experiment in physical enhancement, and falsificaso along with it, calling it the antidote, and have them test the effects."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"But who is it? This someone who'll use Droga... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Who would take on something that dangerous..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> don't need to know that much. Leave the rest to me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\能面背景.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">At the time, I didn't understand who it was that would use it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If I'd turned it over in my head just a little more, I might have seen what he really meant.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">We made a terribly foolish choice then.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">In the end, </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> never used the Droga in Megasawa, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> experiment ended in failure.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">By the time April 8 had passed, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> strength was at its limit.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地昼中.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="28"><TXSPS>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="29">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="28">...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="28">die...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="28">it hurts..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPN>From below ground, I could hear </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> voice, full of pain.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Hold on, I'll save you soon.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Keeping out of sight, I went to </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> secret base and―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\女神\注射器透明.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "C" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> knowing nothing of it, I gave myself a dose of falsificaso.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If I threw away my precognition, wouldn't </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> frenzy subside too?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Even if it killed me―if it saved </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
